        <div style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #F3C4D3; margin-bottom: 4px;">98%</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #E0D3D8; line-height: 1.4;">Confirmed zero heavy mineral oil residue or pore clogging</div>
