        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #E0D3D8; line-height: 1.4;">Black Queens have elevated their daily crown & edge confidence</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA Scroll Back to Buybox -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 36px;">
      <a href="#zvhcBuyBoxSection" class="zvhc-btn-primary" style="display: inline-block; width: auto; padding: 16px 36px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">
        CLAIM YOUR RITUAL TODAY →
